WEBVTT

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:08.346
Good morning, I'm Anders Fjell, and this is Nordic Crypto.

00:00:08.898 --> 00:00:13.929
This week: the US Justice Department says a court has
authorised the seizure or freezing of more than one point

00:00:13.929 --> 00:00:15.742
two billion dollars stolen from Binance.

00:00:15.742 --> 00:00:20.804
The Norwegian government says data centres used for crypto
will not count as socially beneficial.

00:00:20.804 --> 00:00:26.039
And Børsen reports extremely limited customer interest in
crypto products at Danske Bank and Nordea.

00:00:28.182 --> 00:00:33.215
The US Department of Justice said on the twelfth of November
that a court has authorised the seizure or freezing of more

00:00:33.215 --> 00:00:36.276
than one point two billion dollars in cryptocurrency stolen
from Binance.

00:00:36.276 --> 00:00:39.832
More than two point seven billion dollars have already been
frozen.

00:00:39.832 --> 00:00:43.602
The FBI attributes the theft to the group it calls
TraderTraitor.

00:00:43.602 --> 00:00:45.959
That is the FBI's attribution.

00:00:45.959 --> 00:00:51.327
The same release also covers a separate scheme, FaceStealer,
which is not a new Binance theft.

00:00:51.327 --> 00:00:53.459
VG reported the release.

00:00:54.002 --> 00:01:00.031
Lithuania's Axiology has received an expanded MiFID
authorisation from the Bank of Lithuania, Kaupr reports,

00:01:00.031 --> 00:01:01.092
citing the company.

00:01:01.092 --> 00:01:05.703
The authorisation covers receiving, transmitting and
executing client orders.

00:01:05.703 --> 00:01:11.123
Axiology says institutions can subscribe and redeem units in
tokenised money-market funds through it.

00:01:11.123 --> 00:01:14.924
The firm already operates under the EU DLT Pilot Regime.

00:01:15.478 --> 00:01:19.740
The Norwegian government will start work on a licensing
scheme for data centres.

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:24.950
That is a press release on the ninth of November from the
Ministry of Digitalisation and Public Governance and the

00:01:24.950 --> 00:01:26.595
Ministry of Energy, Shifter reports.

00:01:26.595 --> 00:01:31.779
The government said facilities used for crypto activity will
not be treated as socially beneficial.

00:01:31.779 --> 00:01:35.857
It aims to present the main principles in the autumn of
twenty twenty-seven.

00:01:35.857 --> 00:01:39.976
Statnett has separately paused new grid reservations for
data centres.

00:01:40.530 --> 00:01:46.260
Norwegian Block Exchange and Aprikos Venture have signed a
joint venture for a planned Pakistan exchange called

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:48.686
Nayapaisa, Kaupr reports, citing the companies.

00:01:48.686 --> 00:01:54.044
They have applied to Pakistan's Virtual Assets Regulatory
Authority for a No Objection Certificate.

00:01:54.044 --> 00:01:56.585
That application is a first step.

00:01:56.585 --> 00:02:01.165
The exchange will not serve customers until both the
certificate and a licence are granted.

00:02:01.165 --> 00:02:05.858
The plan is deposits and withdrawals in Pakistani rupees
through licensed Pakistani banks.

00:02:07.998 --> 00:02:13.638
According to Flamman's own investigation, companies and
people around Valuno's former chief executive, Daniel

00:02:13.638 --> 00:02:18.346
Sonesson, have continued to operate in payments, including
services used by online casinos.

00:02:18.346 --> 00:02:20.877
Those links are the paper's findings.

00:02:20.877 --> 00:02:25.693
Sweden's Economic Crime Authority has charged Sonesson with
aggravated insider trading.

00:02:25.693 --> 00:02:28.900
He denies wrongdoing, according to Svenska Dagbladet.

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:31.184
A charge is not a conviction.

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:37.153
Crédit Mutuel Arkéa has confirmed a cyberattack through a
service provider's platform, and said the funds may then

00:02:37.153 --> 00:02:39.056
have been converted into cryptocurrency.

00:02:39.056 --> 00:02:43.000
That is the bank's statement of the fourth of November,
Realtid reports.

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:48.707
Blockchain investigator ZachXBT first flagged large
unauthorised withdrawals from crypto-exchange accounts.

00:02:48.707 --> 00:02:52.888
Realtid cites figures of about one hundred and thirty-three
million dollars.

00:02:52.888 --> 00:02:55.500
The bank has not confirmed that amount.

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:58.513
It said it could only validate the order of magnitude.

00:03:00.662 --> 00:03:05.934
Customer interest in crypto products at Danske Bank and
Nordea has been extremely limited, Børsen reports, even

00:03:05.934 --> 00:03:08.213
though the banks have spoken of strong interest.

00:03:08.213 --> 00:03:13.746
A staff paper from Danmarks Nationalbank, dated the
fifteenth of April twenty twenty-six, not a new November

00:03:13.746 --> 00:03:17.383
survey, found that household exposure to crypto in Denmark
remains low.

00:03:17.383 --> 00:03:21.338
It noted that the two banks now offer crypto exchange-traded
products.

00:03:21.338 --> 00:03:26.774
Danske Bank said on the eleventh of February that customers
on its platform can invest in selected products that track

00:03:26.774 --> 00:03:27.742
bitcoin and ethereum.

00:03:29.882 --> 00:03:35.066
Yle reports that the Finnish tax office says fewer than one
in six crypto traders in Finland declare their trades.

00:03:35.066 --> 00:03:39.790
That share has not been confirmed in the tax authority's
published notes on the new reporting duty.

00:03:39.790 --> 00:03:45.332
From next year, the authority is due to receive data from
Finnish and foreign crypto-asset service providers,

00:03:45.332 --> 00:03:46.603
according to Vero dot fi.

00:03:47.158 --> 00:03:49.525
That's all for issue number seven.

00:03:49.525 --> 00:03:52.015
Every story is at nordiccrypto.no.

00:03:52.015 --> 00:03:54.463
Nothing here is investment advice.

00:03:56.156 --> 00:03:57.098
I'm Anders Fjell.

00:03:57.188 --> 00:03:58.008
See you next week.

